# CONCEPT_MASTER — look_round.pdl (generator look concept, D32). Roundness of a thing: each layer is cut to a superellipse of its own bounding box, exponent 8 - 6 x WEIGHT (0 = as drawn, 1 = fully round). Negative weights change nothing.
# WEIGHT lives in each SPOKE's slot that POINTS_TO this master (one authoritative copy).
NODE | look_round
KIND | master
N_SLOTS | 8
